  "Id": "fc56f945-ba04-4d10-a516-68a479147016"/*Sigmoid*/,
  "Description": "Applies the logistic sigmoid function 1/(1+e^(Stretch*Value)).\n\nThe output is between 0 and 1 and is 0.5 for a Value of 0. With a positive Stretch the output decreases as Value increases; use a negative Stretch for a rising curve.\n\nSee also: [SmoothStep], [Remap]",
